WEBVTT

NOTE
Disc 2 - Scene 26h: Sorceress Adel Released From Containment
Duration: ~24 seconds
Lunatic Pandora Interior Chamber
For blind and low-vision players using screen readers

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.000
The massive containment capsule housing Adel begins to crack. Fissures spider-web across 
the translucent walls with a sound like breaking crystal. Sparks of electrical energy 
burst from the ruptures. The sickly purple light flares brighter, almost blinding.

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:08.000
The containment pod shatters completely. Shards of crystalline material explode outward, 
scattering across the chamber floor. The entire structure collapses inward, releasing a 
wave of pressurized energy that shakes the ground beneath the party's feet.

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:12.000
Sorceress Adel emerges from the wreckage. She is impossibly tall and imposing — towering 
at least twelve to fifteen feet high. Her muscular frame is covered in red-orange skin with 
an almost metallic sheen. Her body is lean and powerful, every muscle visibly tense and 
ready for combat. Her face is striking and angular, with an expression of primal fury and 
dominion.

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:16.000
Adel extends her arms to her sides, breathing heavily as if awakening from a centuries-long 
slumber. Her fingers are long and clawed. Energy crackles around her form as centuries of 
pent-up power surge through her body. The air itself seems to warp around her presence.

00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:20.000
In Adel's grasp, held almost carelessly, is Rinoa Heartilly — unconscious and limp. Adel 
has already performed the junction, merging with Rinoa to absorb her Sorceress powers. Rinoa's 
body is pale and motionless, her brunette hair hanging limply. She appears small and fragile 
against Adel's imposing frame.

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:24.000
Adel looks down at her captured prey with cruel satisfaction. The party must now challenge 
the ancient Sorceress and somehow free Rinoa from her possession before it is too late.
